# Serve files exactly as committed.
#
# Without this, GitHub Pages runs Jekyll, which renders README.md as the site
# root, mangles paths that begin with an underscore, and hides files it decides
# are not web content. The deck is a single static HTML file and needs none of
# that: this file tells Pages to publish the tree verbatim, so
# https://krezna06.github.io/obs-deck/ serves index.html as-is.
